    <node id="1376dac4-d991-4737-932f-f9bf4108daac">
      <data key="d0">{"name":"Variable Universal Life Policy Details","text":"┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│         VARIABLE UNIVERSAL LIFE INSURANCE POLICY                  │\n│         Pinnacle Investment Life Corp.                            │\n└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\nPolicy Number: PIL-VUL-2024-5521\nPolicy Date: April 5, 2024\n\n┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  INSURED PARTY                                                    │\n└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\nName: Dr. Amanda Katherine Foster\nDate of Birth: September 3, 1975\nGender: Female | Age at Issue: 48 | Class: Preferred Plus\n\n┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  POLICY SPECIFICATIONS                                            │\n└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\nInitial Face Amount: $1,000,000\nPlanned Annual Premium: $12,000\nDeath Benefit Option: Option II (Face + Account Value)\n\n┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  BENEFICIARIES                                                    │\n└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\nPrimary: Michael Thomas Foster (Spouse) - 100%\nSecondary: Foster Children's Trust - 100%\n\n┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  SECTION 1: IMPORTANT DEFINITIONS                                 │\n└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n1.1 \"Sub-Account\" means a segregated investment account that \n    invests in shares of a designated mutual fund.\n\n1.2 \"Unit Value\" means the value of one unit of a sub-account, \n    calculated daily based on fund performance.\n\n1.3 \"Accumulation Units\" means units held in sub-accounts before \n    any distributions.\n\n1.4 \"Mortality and Expense Risk Charge\" (M&amp;E) is a daily charge \n    of 0.90% annually to cover insurance risks and administrative \n    costs.\n\n┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  SECTION 2: INVESTMENT ALLOCATION                                 │\n└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n2.1 Premium payments (after premium load) are allocated to \n    sub","summary":"This Variable Universal Life Insurance Policy, issued to Dr. Amanda Katherine Foster, features an initial death benefit of $1 million and planned annual premiums of $12,000 under Option II, which pays the face amount plus accumulated account value upon death. The policy includes a Mortality and Expense Risk Charge of 0.90% per annum and allocates funds into sub-accounts tied to mutual funds. Beneficiaries include her spouse as primary and a trust for their children as secondary.","topics":["Life Insurance","Investment Allocation","Premium Structure","Beneficiary Designation"],"facts":[{"name":"Policy Identification","sentence":"Policy Number is PIL-VUL-2024-5521.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Policy Number","Insurance Contract Identifier"],"entities":[{"name":"Pinnacle Investment Life Corp.","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer of policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"VARIABLE UNIVERSAL LIFE INSURANCE POLICY","type":"POLICY","role":"insurance contract issued under policy number","relational_anchors":["PIL-VUL-2024-5521"]},{"name":"April 5, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"effective date of policy issuance","relational_anchors":["Policy Date: April 5, 2024"]},{"name":"Dr. Amanda Katherine Foster","type":"PERSON","role":"primary insured party under policy","relational_anchors":["Date of Birth: September 3, 1975","Age at Issue: 48","Class: Preferred Plus"]},{"name":"Michael Thomas Foster","type":"PERSON","role":"primary beneficiary spouse","relational_anchors":["Primary: Michael Thomas Foster (Spouse) - 100%"]},{"name":"Foster Children's Trust","type":"TRUST","role":"secondary beneficiary trust","relational_anchors":["Secondary: Foster Children's Trust - 100%"]},{"name":"Sub-Account","type":"CONCEPT","role":"investment vehicle for premium allocation","relational_anchors":["Section 1: Important Definitions","1.1 \"Sub-Account\" means..."]},{"name":"Unit Value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"daily valuation metric per unit in sub-account","relational_anchors":["1.2 \"Unit Value\" means...","calculated daily based on fund performance"]},{"name":"Accumulation Units","type":"CONCEPT","role":"units representing pre-distribution holdings","relational_anchors":["1.3 \"Accumulation Units\" means units held in sub-accounts before any distributions."]},{"name":"Mortality and Expense Risk Charge (M&amp;E)","type":"CHARGE","role":"daily fee covering risk and admin expenses","relational_anchors":["1.4 M&amp;E is a daily charge of 0.90% annually"]},{"name":"$1,000,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"initial face amount of death benefit","relational_anchors":["Initial Face Amount: $1,000,000"]},{"name":"$12,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"planned annual premium amount","relational_anchors":["Planned Annual Premium: $12,000"]}]},{"name":"Policy Effective Date","sentence":"Policy Date is April 5, 2024.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Policy Date","Effective Start Date","Contract Initiation"],"entities":[{"name":"Pinnacle Investment Life Corp.","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer of policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"VARIABLE UNIVERSAL LIFE INSURANCE POLICY","type":"POLICY","role":"insurance contract issued under policy number","relational_anchors":["PIL-VUL-2024-5521"]},{"name":"April 5, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"effective date of policy issuance","relational_anchors":["Policy Date: April 5, 2024"]},{"name":"Dr. Amanda Katherine Foster","type":"PERSON","role":"primary insured party under policy","relational_anchors":["Date of Birth: September 3, 1975","Age at Issue: 48","Class: Preferred Plus"]},{"name":"Michael Thomas Foster",