      <data key="d0">{"name":"Investment &amp; Fee Structure Overview","text":"───────────────────────────┐\n│  SECTION 2: INVESTMENT ALLOCATION                                 │\n└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n2.1 Premium payments (after premium load) are allocated to \n    sub-accounts based on your investment instructions.\n\n2.2 Available Sub-Accounts:\n    • Equity Growth Fund\n    • Balanced Allocation Fund\n    • Government Bond Fund\n    • International Equity Fund\n    • Money Market Fund (guaranteed minimum 1.5%)\n    • Real Estate Securities Fund\n\n2.3 Current Allocation:\n    Equity Growth Fund: 40%\n    Balanced Allocation Fund: 30%\n    Government Bond Fund: 20%\n    Money Market Fund: 10%\n\n2.4 You may change allocations at any time by written request \n    or through our online portal. No fee for first 12 changes \n    per year; $25 fee thereafter.\n\n┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  SECTION 3: CHARGES AND FEES                                      │\n└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n3.1 PREMIUM LOAD: 5.0% of each premium payment\n\n3.2 MORTALITY &amp; EXPENSE RISK CHARGE: 0.90% per annum of account \n    value, deducted daily\n\n3.3 ADMINISTRATIVE CHARGE: $15 per month\n\n3.4 COST OF INSURANCE: Monthly charge based on:\n    (Face Amount at Risk) × (Monthly COI Rate) / 1,000\n    Face Amount at Risk = Death Benefit - Account Value\n\n3.5 FUND EXPENSES: Each sub-account has its own expense ratio \n    ranging from 0.45% to 1.25% annually (detailed in prospectus)\n\n3.6 SURRENDER CHARGE SCHEDULE (% of premium paid):\n    Year 1-2: 7% | Year 3-4: 5% | Year 5-6: 3% | Year 7+: 0%\n\n┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  SECTION 4: DEATH BENEFIT OPTIONS                                 │\n└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n4.1 OPTION I - Level Death Benefit\n    Death Benefit =","summary":"Premium payments after a 5% loading are allocated across six sub-accounts according to investor directives, with current holdings split between equity growth (40%), balanced allocation (30%), government bonds (20%), money market (10%), and others. Ongoing costs include a 0.90% annual mortality risk charge, $15 monthly admin fee, variable cost-of-insurance based on face amount at risk, fund-specific expense ratios (0.45%-1.25%), and surrender charges declining over time. Investors can modify allocations freely up to 12 times yearly without penalty, with subsequent changes costing $25.","topics":["Investment Allocation","Fees and Charges","Death Benefit Options","Sub-Account Management"],"facts":[{"name":"Premium Load Application","sentence":"Premium payments are made after applying a premium load.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["premium load","investment allocation","charge deduction"],"entities":[{"name":"Equity Growth Fund","type":"SUB_ACCOUNT","role":"primary growth-oriented investment vehicle","relational_anchors":["40%"]},{"name":"Balanced Allocation Fund","type":"SUB_ACCOUNT","role":"moderate-risk diversified portfolio","relational_anchors":["30%"]},{"name":"Government Bond Fund","type":"SUB_ACCOUNT","role":"low-volatility fixed-income holding","relational_anchors":["20%"]},{"name":"International Equity Fund","type":"SUB_ACCOUNT","role":"global stock market exposure option","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Money Market Fund","type":"SUB_ACCOUNT","role":"short-term stable-value investment","relational_anchors":["guaranteed minimum 1.5%","10%"]},{"name":"Real Estate Securities Fund","type":"SUB_ACCOUNT","role":"real estate-backed equity investment","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"5.0%","type":"AMOUNT","role":"premium loading deduction rate","relational_anchors":["PREMIUM LOAD"]},{"name":"0.90% per annum","type":"RATE","role":"daily risk charge against account value","relational_anchors":["MORTALITY &amp; EXPENSE RISK CHARGE"]},{"name"