      <data key="d0">{"name":"Policy Terms and Exclusions Overview","text":"───────────────────────────┐\n│  SECTION 7: POLICY LAPSE AND REINSTATEMENT                        │\n└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n7.1 If account value is insufficient to cover monthly deductions \n    for 61 consecutive days, the policy will lapse.\n\n7.2 Lapse notice will be sent at least 30 days before lapse.\n\n7.3 Reinstatement within 3 years requires:\n    • Evidence of insurability\n    • Payment of all back charges plus 6% interest\n    • Repayment of outstanding loans\n\n┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  SECTION 8: EXCLUSIONS                                            │\n└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n8.1 SUICIDE: If death occurs by suicide within 2 years of issue \n    or reinstatement, we pay only premiums paid minus withdrawals.\n\n8.2 WAR EXCLUSION: Death while serving in military conflict in a \n    war zone is excluded if it occurs within 24 months of issue.\n\n8.3 AVIATION: Death resulting from operating an aircraft as pilot \n    or crew member is excluded unless declared and approved with \n    extra premium.\n\n┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  SECTION 9: REGULATORY INFORMATION                                │\n└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n9.1 This policy is issued in connection with Pinnacle Investment \n    Life Separate Account A, a registered unit investment trust.\n\n9.2 The prospectus for the Separate Account and underlying funds \n    must be read carefully before investing.\n\n9.3 This is a securities product subject to SEC regulation.\n\n┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  EXECUTION                                                        │\n│                                                                   │\n│  Pinnacle Investment Life Corp.                                   │\n│  New York, New York                                               │\n│                                                                   │\n│  ____________________________    April 5, 2024                    │\n│  President &amp; CEO                                                  │\n└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n","summary":"If a policy's account value cannot cover monthly deductions for 61 consecutive days, it will lapse, with a minimum 30-day notice provided. Within three years of lapse, reinstatement is possible upon proof of insurability, payment of overdue amounts plus 6% interest, and repayment of any outstanding loans. Key exclusions include suicide within two years of issuance or reinstatement, death during active military service in a war zone within 24 months, and aviation-related deaths unless specifically approved. The policy is part of a regulated securities product tied to a separate investment account governed by SEC oversight.","topics":["Policy Lapse","Reinstatement Conditions","Exclusions","Regulatory Compliance"],"facts":[{"name":"Policy Lapse Condition","sentence":"If an account's value is insufficient to cover monthly deductions for 61 consecutive days, the policy will lapse.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["policy lapse","account value deficiency","61-day deduction period"],"entities":[{"name":"Pinnacle Investment Life Corp.","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuer of the life insurance policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"New York, New York","type":"LOCATION","role":"headquarters location of issuer","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"POLICY LAPSE","type":"CONCEPT","role":"condition triggering loss of coverage","relational_anchors":["61 consecutive days"]},{"name":"April 5, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"execution date of policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"REINSTATEMENT","type":"CONCEPT","role":"process to restore lapsed policy","relational_anchors":["within 3 years","6% interest","all back charges"]},{"name":"EVIDENCE OF INSURABILITY","type":"CONCEPT","role":"requirement for reinstatement","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"SUICIDE EXCLUSION","type":"CONCEPT","role":"death benefit limitation under clause","relational_anchors":["within 2 years of issue or reinstatement"]},{"name":"WAR EXCLUSION","type":"CONCEPT","role":"exclusion due to military service in war zone","relational_anchors":["within 24 months of issue"]},{"name":"AVIATION EXCLUSION","type":"CONCEPT","role":"exclusion for flight-related deaths","relational_anchors":["operating an aircraft as pilot or crew member"]},{"name":"BACK CHARGES","type":"CONCEPT","role":"unpaid fees owed upon reinstatement","relational_anchors":["plus 6% interest"]},{"name":"OUTSTANDING LOANS","type":"CONCEPT","role":"debt obligation requiring repayment","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"UNIT INVESTMENT TRUST","type":"CONCEPT","role":"investment vehicle associated with policy","relational_anchors":["Pinnacle Investment Life Separate Account A"]},{"name":"prospectus","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"regulatory disclosure required prior to investment","relational_anchors":["for the Separate Account and underlying funds"]},{"name":"SEC regulation","type":"REGULATION","role":"governing authority over securities aspect","relational_anchors":[]}]},{"name":"Lapse Notice Timing","sentence":"A lapse notice will be sent at least 30 days before the policy lapses.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["lapse notice","policy lapse","notification period"],"entities":[{"name":"Pinnacle Investment Life Corp.","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuer of the life insurance policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"New York, New York","type":"LOCATION","role":"headquarters location of issuer","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"POLICY LAPSE","type":"CONCEPT","role":"condition triggering loss of coverage","relational_anchors":["61 consecutive days"]},{"name":"April 5, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"execution date of policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"REINSTATEMENT","type":"CONCEPT","role":"process to restore lapsed policy","relational_anchors":["within 3 years","6% interest","all back charges"]},{"name":"EVIDENCE OF INSURABILITY","type":"CONCEPT","role":"requirement for reinstatement","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"SUICIDE EXCLUSION","type":"CONCEPT","role":"death benefit limitation under clause","relational_anchors":["within 2 years of issue or reinstatement"]},{"name":"WAR EXCLUSION","type":"CONCEPT","role":"exclusion due to military service in war zone","relational_anchors":["within 24 months of issue"]},{"name":"AVIATION EXCLUSION","type":"CONCEPT","role":"exclusion for flight-related deaths","relational_anchors":["operating an aircraft as pilot or crew member"]},{"name":"BACK CHARGES","type":"CONCEPT","role":"unpaid fees owed upon reinstatement","relational_anchors":["plus 6% interest"]},{"name":"OUTSTANDING LOANS","type":"CONCEPT","role":"debt obligation requiring repayment","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"UNIT INVESTMENT TRUST","type":"CONCEPT","role":"investment vehicle associated with policy","relational_anchors":["Pinnacle Investment Life Separate Account A"]},{"name":"prospectus","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"regulatory disclosure required prior to investment","relational_anchors":["for the Separate Account and underlying funds"]},{"name":"SEC regulation","type":"REGULATION","role":"governing authority over securities aspect","relational_anchors":[]}]},{"name":"Evidence of Insurability Requirement","sentence":"Reinstatement within 3 years requires evidence of insurability.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["policy reinstatement","insurability verification","lapse recovery conditions"],"entities":[{"name":"Pinnacle Investment Life Corp.","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuer of the life insurance policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"New York, New York","type":"LOCATION","role":"headquarters location of issuer","relational_anchors":[]},{"name"