      <data key="d3">The initial face amount of $1 million is the death benefit designated for the insured party, Dr. Amanda Katherine Foster, as specified in the policy terms.</data>
      <data key="d4">assigned to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6f5fd4c3-4d4e-467b-8e2b-426f62766921" target="3ee62998-6a05-40f4-921c-b0c4be892b48">
      <data key="d3">The initial face amount of $1 million establishes the baseline payout for the death benefit, making it essential for determining the scope of Option II's payment terms.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
