      <data key="d3">The $12,000 annual premium reflects the cost of maintaining coverage for Dr. Amanda Katherine Foster, linking the payment obligation directly to the named insured party.</data>
      <data key="d4">related to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
