      <data key="d3">The planned annual premium of $12,000 is set independently based on policy terms; however, it is informed by demographic factors such as the insured's age at issue, which helps establish baseline cost structures.</data>
      <data key="d4">drives</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
