      <data key="d3">The planned annual premium of $12,000 serves as the source funding for investment allocations within the policy’s sub-accounts, subject to applicable charges like the premium load.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
