      <data key="d3">Option II, which provides a death benefit equal to the face amount plus account value, is subject to proportional reductions when partial withdrawals occur, ensuring the payout reflects reduced policy reserves.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
