      <data key="d3">The death benefit defined in fact_sentence_1 can be reduced by policy loans, which subtract from the account value used in the calculation. Thus, borrowing against the policy lowers the actual payout despite the stated formula.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.87</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="67add080-3372-4301-bd74-0e6a0c67fa5b" target="67ae83fb-0cf5-44ec-b533-6271ab72c41e">
      <data key="d3">The death benefit under Option II depends on the face amount, which can be reduced by partial withdrawals exceeding $1,000. Therefore, withdrawal activity impacts the final payout defined in fact_sentence_1.</data>
