    </edge>
    <edge source="85d2239e-5427-43be-b9c3-62f248d4781e" target="673f04b9-0b00-413b-9fe0-acc4d73bc0db">
      <data key="d3">The primary beneficiary's 100% ownership indicates that all death benefits will go exclusively to them, reinforcing the significance of identifying the correct insured person, such as Dr. Amanda Katherine Foster, to ensure proper disbursement according to intent.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="85d2239e-5427-43be-b9c3-62f248d4781e" target="67add080-3372-4301-bd74-0e6a0c67fa5b">
      <data key="d3">The primary beneficiary receives 100% of the death benefit, which, under Option II, consists of the face amount plus the account value.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="85d2239e-5427-43be-b9c3-62f248d4781e" target="3aa92416-01dc-4fb4-901b-04bf91ba4c2b">
      <data key="d3">Michael Thomas Foster is designated as the sole recipient of the death benefit, confirmed by his 100% ownership stake in the primary beneficiary position.</data>
      <data key="d4">explains</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="85d2239e-5427-43be-b9c3-62f248d4781e" target="2a9798d0-4ad9-4bcf-9e30-219824f873d8">
      <data key="d3">The 100% Primary Beneficiary Ownership percentage confirms that Michael Thomas Foster, as the spouse, receives the entire death benefit, aligning with his stated relationship to the insured.</data>
      <data key="d4">justified by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="85d2239e-5427-43be-b9c3-62f248d4781e" target="ee48c30b-3bf6-4f6b-acb3-b55f04f44cd8">
      <data key="d3">The primary beneficiary holds full ownership rights (100%) over the death benefit payout, ensuring they are entitled to receive proceeds unless otherwise disqualified; the secondary beneficiary, Foster Children’s Trust, would only inherit if the primary beneficiary does not survive or fails to claim.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
