      <data key="d3">Designating the Foster Children's Trust as the secondary beneficiary aligns with the overall distribution framework established by choosing Option II, ensuring continuity of financial support after the primary beneficiary.</data>
      <data key="d4">complies with</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
