      <data key="d3">The Foster Children's Trust serves as the contingent recipient when the primary beneficiary, Michael Thomas Foster, cannot inherit. It ensures that the benefits are distributed according to the policyholder’s intent should the primary beneficiary fail to qualify.</data>
      <data key="d4">follows</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
