      <data key="d3">The designation of the Foster Children's Trust as the secondary beneficiary implies the presence of minor or dependent children, whose legal guardianship and inheritance rights are linked through the marriage of Dr. Amanda Katherine Foster and Michael Thomas Foster.</data>
      <data key="d4">justifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ee48c30b-3bf6-4f6b-acb3-b55f04f44cd8" target="85d2239e-5427-43be-b9c3-62f248d4781e">
      <data key="d3">Foster Children’s Trust serves as the contingent recipient of the death benefit after the primary beneficiary, whose 100% ownership percentage establishes the order of distribution in case of the primary’s unavailability.</data>
