    <edge source="f655db57-9079-41c0-80b8-f555479b92bd" target="ebbf5cd2-4a0e-4c96-a21c-71b0ce22c1d2">
      <data key="d3">Sub-accounts serve as vehicles through which premiums and policyholder funds are invested, supporting the long-term growth potential linked to the policy’s benefits.</data>
      <data key="d4">investment vehicle</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f655db57-9079-41c0-80b8-f555479b92bd" target="de306b66-0150-43cd-a96c-13419925c4f3">
      <data key="d3">Sub-Accounts are investment vehicles tied to mutual funds; therefore, their unit values fluctuate daily based on the underlying fund's performance.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f655db57-9079-41c0-80b8-f555479b92bd" target="fcdeb251-2bd8-4d1c-99e4-7dccc6341fb7">
      <data key="d3">A Sub-Account pools investments in a specific mutual fund, and its performance determines the Unit Value—the price per unit within that account.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f655db57-9079-41c0-80b8-f555479b92bd" target="d75d6f5b-d1c8-41ad-b706-f720effdd433">
      <data key="d3">Sub-Accounts serve as investment vehicles holding assets like mutual fund shares, and Accumulation Units represent ownership interests within these accounts before payouts or distributions occur.</data>
      <data key="d4">part of</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f655db57-9079-41c0-80b8-f555479b92bd" target="1ea37a9c-a314-44d4-942c-f27d3a8728df">
      <data key="d3">Sub-accounts function as dedicated investment vehicles tied to mutual funds, receiving premium allocations after fees are applied, thus enabling investment growth within the insurance policy framework.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.87</data>
    </edge>
