      <data key="d3">Daily recalculation of unit value ensures accurate tracking of investment gains and losses within sub-accounts, directly influencing the total account value used in determining payouts under Option II.</data>
      <data key="d4">contributes to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de306b66-0150-43cd-a96c-13419925c4f3" target="67add080-3372-4301-bd74-0e6a0c67fa5b">
      <data key="d3">Daily recalculations of unit value ensure up-to-date account values used in determining the final death benefit under Option II.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de306b66-0150-43cd-a96c-13419925c4f3" target="f655db57-9079-41c0-80b8-f555479b92bd">
      <data key="d3">Daily calculation of Unit Value relies on the performance of mutual funds held within Sub-Accounts, making it contingent on their existence and function.</data>
      <data key="d4">drives</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de306b66-0150-43cd-a96c-13419925c4f3" target="fcdeb251-2bd8-4d1c-99e4-7dccc6341fb7">
      <data key="d3">Daily recalculation of Unit Value ensures it remains aligned with real-time changes in the associated mutual fund’s performance, making the valuation dynamic and responsive.</data>
      <data key="d4">caused by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de306b66-0150-43cd-a96c-13419925c4f3" target="2ac01dcd-f72c-441c-8596-afeaf23404ad">
      <data key="d3">The daily calculation of unit value relies on fund performance, which is affected by deductions such as the daily Mortality and Expense Risk Charge. Thus, the M&amp;E charge directly influences how unit value changes over time.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de306b66-0150-43cd-a96c-13419925c4f3" target="d75d6f5b-d1c8-41ad-b706-f720effdd433">
      <data key="d3">Unit value calculations drive the current worth of Accumulation Units by reflecting real-time fund performance. Without daily updates to unit value, the value of holdings in sub-accounts could not be accurately assessed.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de306b66-0150-43cd-a96c-13419925c4f3" target="15773119-4ea5-47b0-8cfd-6116e4cb5765">
      <data key="d3">Unit value depends on daily fund performance, but this value is reduced by the Mortality and Expense Risk Charge, which is applied consistently over time.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de306b66-0150-43cd-a96c-13419925c4f3" target="1ea37a9c-a314-44d4-942c-f27d3a8728df">
      <data key="d3">The daily calculation of unit values reflects changes in fund performance, which determines the price at which premium allocations are made into sub-accounts.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
