    <edge source="81e49cb2-9973-4f29-93f9-b747d6bd02ec" target="49459120-af42-471a-a0d9-d0ea5424bead">
      <data key="d3">The first sentence indicates that a premium load reduces the effective premium amount; the second clarifies that this reduction occurs via a fixed 5.0% load per payment, making it clear how the adjustment operates.</data>
      <data key="d4">explains</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="81e49cb2-9973-4f29-93f9-b747d6bd02ec" target="c7801d49-390a-4eb6-a6cc-c11043c369ef">
      <data key="d3">The premium load reduces the total payment before distribution. After deducting the 5% loading, the remainder becomes available for investment into specified sub-accounts.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="81e49cb2-9973-4f29-93f9-b747d6bd02ec" target="1dbe7802-6ae3-4a4f-a1b6-0103ad7965b5">
      <data key="d3">After a 5% loading is applied, premium payments become available for allocation. These adjusted amounts are then assigned to sub-accounts based on the investor’s specified preferences.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="81e49cb2-9973-4f29-93f9-b747d6bd02ec" target="de269cdd-b80a-4bb9-adc9-121b0cf85281">
      <data key="d3">Loaded premiums serve as the funding source for investments in designated sub-accounts, such as the Equity Growth Fund, enabling investors to allocate capital into targeted portfolios per their directives.</data>
      <data key="d4">funding source</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.87</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="81e49cb2-9973-4f29-93f9-b747d6bd02ec" target="c6b46ac7-78f4-449c-8b45-6fd65adfbba6">
      <data key="d3">Premiums are adjusted by a loading before entering the account, enabling allocation into designated sub-accounts like the Balanced Allocation Fund. This reflects part of the initial capital deployment process within the investment framework.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="81e49cb2-9973-4f29-93f9-b747d6bd02ec" target="452470ff-1e32-43f1-8de7-0e950227006a">
      <data key="d3">Premiums paid after a 5% loading are distributed among various sub-accounts, including the International Equity Fund, reflecting how investor-directed funds are deployed into specific investment vehicles.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="81e49cb2-9973-4f29-93f9-b747d6bd02ec" target="a6548f00-c863-44e8-a21a-b412497ba0bc">
      <data key="d3">Premiums, after being increased by a 5% loading, are distributed among various sub-accounts including the Money Market Fund as part of the investment strategy.</data>
      <data key="d4">allocated to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="81e49cb2-9973-4f29-93f9-b747d6bd02ec" target="c2037215-53c9-4630-94af-e8bb4930956c">
      <data key="d3">After a 5% loading is applied, premium payments are directed into various sub-accounts, such as the Real Estate Securities Fund, which is among the listed investment options.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="81e49cb2-9973-4f29-93f9-b747d6bd02ec" target="5471d238-37e9-4478-8504-a41c8fe37a7b">
      <data key="d3">Premiums are adjusted by a 5% loading prior to being allocated among investment sub-accounts. This loaded premium forms the basis for distributing assets, including the 40% assigned to the Equity Growth Fund.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="81e49cb2-9973-4f29-93f9-b747d6bd02ec" target="3014df8f-db7d-4af8-9b3e-fa9f179736e5">
      <data key="d3">Premiums are adjusted by a 5% loading prior to being distributed into investment sub-accounts. This loaded payment forms the basis for allocating funds across various accounts, including the Balanced Allocation Fund, which currently holds 30% of total investments.</data>
      <data key="d4">postload allocation</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="81e49cb2-9973-4f29-93f9-b747d6bd02ec" target="9038831d-df01-4459-b72d-e7af64e0f57a">
      <data key="d3">Premiums are increased by a 5% loading prior to being distributed into sub-accounts, ensuring initial capital inflow reflects loaded amounts. Each resulting sub-account incurs separate annual expense ratios, reflecting individual management costs post-allocation.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="212816ef-78d5-4f2b-9750-0e3e26b17328" target="81e49cb2-9973-4f29-93f9-b747d6bd02ec">
