      <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 identifies the availability of an equity-focused sub-account, while fact sentence 2 confirms another distinct option—the Government Bond Fund—which complements it by offering fixed-income exposure. Together, they illustrate diversity in investment choice.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
