      <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 identifies one of the available sub-accounts—Equity Growth Fund—which is also listed in the chunk summary. Fact sentence 2 similarly confirms another available option—the Money Market Fund—consistent with the stated distribution of holdings.</data>
      <data key="d4">exists within</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
