      <data key="d3">The Equity Growth Fund is among the available sub-accounts, making it possible for investors to allocate funds into it. This availability directly supports the current 40% allocation observed in practice.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
