      <data key="d3">The presence of the Equity Growth Fund among available sub-accounts supports investors' ability to reallocate assets, enabling dynamic portfolio management.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de269cdd-b80a-4bb9-adc9-121b0cf85281" target="e9a445fa-2366-4834-8a4b-4421c9a31eb0">
      <data key="d3">The presence of the Equity Growth Fund as a sub-account enables investors to consider reallocating funds into it when submitting a written request for portfolio adjustments.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
