    </edge>
    <edge source="de269cdd-b80a-4bb9-adc9-121b0cf85281" target="67c7a149-4651-4b13-989b-a037490c835d">
      <data key="d3">The existence of the Equity Growth Fund provides one possible destination for allocation changes, enabling investors to adjust investments within the permitted limits. This supports the practical utility of the free change provision.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
