      <data key="d3">The Equity Growth Fund influences the account value that drives the variable death benefit under Option II, making its performance relevant to the overall benefit calculation.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
