      <data key="d3">The Equity Growth Fund contributes to the overall account value, which directly affects the growing death benefit under Option II. Its inclusion supports the variable component of the death benefit's increase.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
