      <data key="d3">The inclusion of the Equity Growth Fund enables potential appreciation in the policy’s cash value, which directly affects the variable death benefit under Option II, contributing to its non-guaranteed status.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.87</data>
