      <data key="d3">The inclusion of the Real Estate Securities Fund among the sub-accounts means investors may allocate premiums into this vehicle, which could be impacted by partial withdrawals. Thus, any withdrawal might affect exposure to this specific fund depending on asset allocation.</data>
