      <data key="d3">The mention of the Real Estate Securities Fund as an available sub-account provides potential investment choice relevant to long-term accumulation, while the $50 processing fee for partial withdrawals affects liquidity access. Together, they reflect different facets of policy management: investment allocation and withdrawal economics.</data>
