      <data key="d3">The current 40% allocation to the Equity Growth Fund informs investment strategy, enabling investors to decide whether adjustments are needed. These potential changes can be executed using the online portal, allowing dynamic management of portfolio composition.</data>
      <data key="d4">informs action</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
