      <data key="d3">Option I provides no opportunity for investment growth, yet the Money Market sub-account offers a guaranteed minimum return of 1.5%, possibly applicable even under such restrictive options.</data>
      <data key="d4">limits growth</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
