      <data key="d3">The growing death benefit under Option II depends on positive account value appreciation, which is diminished by the ongoing 0.90% M&amp;E charge applied annually.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="fa381acf-443b-4930-8921-e02cc04b1150" target="2ac01dcd-f72c-441c-8596-afeaf23404ad">
      <data key="d3">The growing death benefit under Option II relies on sustained account value growth, which is constrained by the daily deduction of the M&amp;E charge, making the charge a key factor in determining final payout potential.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
