      <data key="d3">The existence of minimum face amount requirements implies constraints on altering the chosen option, thus affecting decisions about maintaining or modifying the current selection of Option II.</data>
      <data key="d4">applies to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="2248cf41-5aff-417f-8516-4b5df05a6c56" target="6e4a5644-f48d-427f-ba8d-2997378c8b42">
      <data key="d3">The existence of minimum face amount requirements limits the feasibility of switching between death benefit options, imposing structural constraints on policyholder flexibility.</data>
      <data key="d4">restricts</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
