      <data key="d3">The necessity to provide proof of insurability when upgrading coverage arises only under specific circumstances tied to minimum face amount rules during option switches.</data>
      <data key="d4">triggers requirement for</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
