      <data key="d3">The absence of a guaranteed account value under Option II means its performance is subject to market risks, which directly influences how the death benefit varies over time based on sub-account returns.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
