      <data key="d3">The absence of a guaranteed account value under Option II means the policyowner assumes full exposure to market volatility, making them responsible for any resulting losses or gains.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
