    <edge source="74e421cc-1b7d-4755-b72f-7b9f5f6bbfe9" target="1d7528cf-578b-4c9e-805a-b6d7077a310f">
      <data key="d3">The absence of a guaranteed account value under Option II exposes the policyholder to financial instability if investments perform poorly, potentially leading to insufficient funds and eventual policy lapse.</data>
