    <edge source="74e421cc-1b7d-4755-b72f-7b9f5f6bbfe9" target="23382f49-1a75-4d65-9ae8-9d92f5aabd4c">
      <data key="d3">The absence of a guaranteed account value under Option II implies that investments outside the Money Market sub-account also lack guaranteed returns, making the condition in fact_sentence_1 foundational to understanding the scope of fact_sentence_2.</data>
      <data key="d4">explains</data>
