      <data key="d3">The lack of guarantee on the account value under the Variable option means its performance fluctuates unpredictably. This volatility affects how much can be borrowed, but every loan still directly diminishes the death benefit by the full amount taken.</data>
      <data key="d4">non guaranteed impacts</data>
