      <data key="d3">The absence of a guaranteed account value under Option II means the actual account balance can vary significantly, thereby determining the maximum allowable partial withdrawal after subtracting $5,000.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
