      <data key="d3">The lack of guaranteed death benefits in Option II stems from its reliance on variable investment returns. This contrasts sharply with Option I, where no growth occurs, ensuring stability without uncertainty.</data>
      <data key="d4">no growth</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
