      <data key="d3">Because the death benefit under Option II includes the account value, it inherently lacks guarantees due to potential market-driven changes in that value.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
