      <data key="d3">Poor performance in the Money Market Fund—or any sub-account—contributes to reduced policy value, making it more likely that the policy will lapse despite the availability of stable options.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.78</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="1d7528cf-578b-4c9e-805a-b6d7077a310f" target="c2037215-53c9-4630-94af-e8bb4930956c">
      <data key="d3">Poor investment outcomes across sub-accounts, such as those involving the Real Estate Securities Fund, increase the likelihood of policy lapse by reducing accumulated cash value below required thresholds.</data>
      <data key="d4">contributes to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
