      <data key="d3">If poor investment performance leads to policy lapse, it suggests underlying issues in asset allocation—including reliance on low-return components such as the 20% held in the Government Bond Fund—which may not generate sufficient growth to sustain the policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
