      <data key="d3">If poor investment performance occurs across the portfolio—including from insufficient gains despite a 10% allocation to the Money Market Fund—the policy risks lapsing, highlighting the importance of diversified and effective capital deployment.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on performance</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.78</data>
