      <data key="d3">Poor investment performance threatens policy solvency by reducing cash value, making it harder to absorb ongoing charges such as surrender fees, thereby increasing reliance on stable performance.</data>
      <data key="d4">increases risk of</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
