    <edge source="82754332-e72e-42c2-8178-8d00ac6d8b55" target="ff1a79b3-08d5-49d1-a8e3-3b8a90ed15c2">
      <data key="d3">If a policy lapses due to insufficient funds, one contributing factor could be that the underlying option (like Option I) lacks any mechanism for account value growth to absorb expenses.</data>
      <data key="d4">caused by</data>
