    </edge>
    <edge source="82754332-e72e-42c2-8178-8d00ac6d8b55" target="74e421cc-1b7d-4755-b72f-7b9f5f6bbfe9">
      <data key="d3">If the account value fails to meet required deductions, the policy risks lapsing. Since the account value under Option II is not guaranteed, such shortfalls stem from unguaranteed market-driven declines, making the instability of the account value a root cause of possible lapse.</data>
      <data key="d4">result of</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
