      <data key="d3">If the account value drops too low to cover ongoing costs, the policy could lapse—a scenario more likely under Option II where benefits are not guaranteed and subject to market volatility.</data>
      <data key="d4">increases risk of</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
