      <data key="d3">If the account value falls too low due to poor investment performance in sub-accounts, the policy risks lapsing because it cannot sustain monthly deductions. This underscores how sub-account results drive financial stability.</data>
      <data key="d4">result of</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
