      <data key="d3">If the account value drops too low due to inadequate returns or fees, the death benefit under the Variable option will decrease accordingly, reflecting reduced underlying asset performance.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
