      <data key="d3">If the account value drops too low to cover monthly deductions, the policy risks lapsing—a consequence made possible because the policyowner, not the insurer, absorbs investment risk.</data>
      <data key="d4">result of</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
