    </edge>
    <edge source="82754332-e72e-42c2-8178-8d00ac6d8b55" target="6609aab0-8bef-493f-a6c7-30042cfc3b43">
      <data key="d3">If a policy’s account value drops too low to meet ongoing charges, it risks lapsing. This financial shortfall could result from large policy loans, which are capped at 90% of surrender value.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
