      <data key="d3">If a policyholder takes loans, the reduced account value increases the chance of failing to cover monthly deductions, potentially causing a lapse. This makes loan activity a contributing factor to the financial instability highlighted in the first statement.</data>
      <data key="d4">contributes to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
