    </edge>
    <edge source="82754332-e72e-42c2-8178-8d00ac6d8b55" target="29d195f0-f43e-425b-a095-af01a0765450">
      <data key="d3">If a policyholder makes large partial withdrawals that exceed the allowable cap, it risks reducing the account value below required levels, potentially leading to a lapse. This constraint helps maintain financial stability within the policy.</data>
