      <data key="d3">If a policy lapses due to insufficient funds, it may still be reinstated within three years by paying missed charges plus 6% interest, as outlined in the second fact.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="82754332-e72e-42c2-8178-8d00ac6d8b55" target="a270d4dd-8dc4-4636-bdb4-68ecbe2ee923">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 describes the cause of policy lapse due to insufficient funds, which triggers the need for reinstatement. Fact_sentence_2 clarifies one essential requirement for reinstatement—repayment of outstanding loans—directly supporting the procedural steps outlined after a lapse.</data>
