      <data key="d3">When a policy risks lapsing due to insufficient account value, one contributing factor is an elevated Face Amount at Risk resulting from reduced Account Values. This highlights how maintaining sufficient account balance prevents increased insurance costs tied to higher risk exposure.</data>
