    <edge source="e908b03d-58ec-43af-9f19-e6a68cc15bb1" target="ff1a79b3-08d5-49d1-a8e3-3b8a90ed15c2">
      <data key="d3">Despite having a guaranteed minimum interest rate of 1.5%, the Money Market sub-account cannot support growth under Option I, which explicitly disallows investment gains.</data>
      <data key="d4">no growth allowed</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="e908b03d-58ec-43af-9f19-e6a68cc15bb1" target="0a3e0c50-8fc9-4679-94bb-856bff774ce7">
      <data key="d3">The presence of a guaranteed minimum interest rate of 1.5% in the Money Market sub-account supports the viability of the Variable option (Option II), providing a safety net even during low-market conditions.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="e908b03d-58ec-43af-9f19-e6a68cc15bb1" target="74e421cc-1b7d-4755-b72f-7b9f5f6bbfe9">
      <data key="d3">A guaranteed minimum interest rate of 1.5% in the Money Market sub-account serves as a partial safeguard against losses, even though the overall account value under Option II remains non-guaranteed.</data>
      <data key="d4">protects</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="e908b03d-58ec-43af-9f19-e6a68cc15bb1" target="fc50e6da-a35a-4b0b-b4b6-a838415c3d5c">
      <data key="d3">The guaranteed minimum interest rate of 1.5% in the Money Market sub-account ensures a baseline level of stability within the otherwise fluctuating account value governed by sub-account performance.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="e908b03d-58ec-43af-9f19-e6a68cc15bb1" target="c77d0c8c-e192-4a05-988c-04e682d69d67">
      <data key="d3">Despite the policy owner bearing total investment risk, the presence of a guaranteed 1.5% minimum on the Money Market sub-account limits downside exposure within that component.</data>
      <data key="d4">qualifies for</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="e908b03d-58ec-43af-9f19-e6a68cc15bb1" target="1d7528cf-578b-4c9e-805a-b6d7077a310f">
      <data key="d3">The guaranteed 1.5% minimum interest rate on the Money Market sub-account helps stabilize the policy’s value, mitigating the risk of lapse from poor investment outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d4">reduces risk of</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="e908b03d-58ec-43af-9f19-e6a68cc15bb1" target="23382f49-1a75-4d65-9ae8-9d92f5aabd4c">
      <data key="d3">The Money Market sub-account offers a guaranteed minimum return of 1.5%, setting it apart from other sub-accounts that do not provide any guaranteed returns.</data>
      <data key="d4">exempt from</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="e908b03d-58ec-43af-9f19-e6a68cc15bb1" target="36ea11ef-2773-4656-b8f6-b515107b1be7">
      <data key="d3">The Money Market sub-account offers a guaranteed minimum interest rate of 1.5%, ensuring stable returns on assets held within it. Loan amounts are directed into this sub-account, meaning borrowers indirectly benefit from its guaranteed yield.</data>
      <data key="d4">enhances earnings</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="c1ad18a1-278c-44f2-9928-039ba6d9d9fd" target="e908b03d-58ec-43af-9f19-e6a68cc15bb1">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">has minimum guaranteed interest rate</data>
    </edge>
