    </edge>
    <edge source="36ea11ef-2773-4656-b8f6-b515107b1be7" target="0a3e0c50-8fc9-4679-94bb-856bff774ce7">
      <data key="d3">Allocating loan amounts to the Money Market sub-account depends on the policy being under the Variable option, which is confirmed by the current selection of Option II.</data>
      <data key="d4">enabled by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="36ea11ef-2773-4656-b8f6-b515107b1be7" target="e908b03d-58ec-43af-9f19-e6a68cc15bb1">
      <data key="d3">Loan amounts are transferred to the Money Market sub-account, contributing to its asset base and potentially earning the guaranteed 1.5% minimum interest. This ensures that such funds generate predictable returns despite broader market volatility.</data>
      <data key="d4">provides funding source</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="36ea11ef-2773-4656-b8f6-b515107b1be7" target="23382f49-1a75-4d65-9ae8-9d92f5aabd4c">
      <data key="d3">The transfer of loan amounts into the Money Market sub-account leverages its guaranteed return feature, providing a safe haven for funds despite the risks associated with other investment options.</data>
      <data key="d4">provides safety</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="36ea11ef-2773-4656-b8f6-b515107b1be7" target="6609aab0-8bef-493f-a6c7-30042cfc3b43">
      <data key="d3">Funds withdrawn via policy loan are placed in the Money Market sub-account, subject to the constraint that total loans cannot exceed 90% of the surrender value.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="36ea11ef-2773-4656-b8f6-b515107b1be7" target="280ab5d3-6e4f-4198-81c8-a2ef27b919d6">
      <data key="d3">The transfer of loan amounts into the Money Market sub-account reflects how borrowed funds are invested, while each such loan directly diminishes the death benefit by an equivalent amount, maintaining alignment between debt and coverage.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="7fa8a9be-6107-4f15-98ec-0cd8e10e0380" target="36ea11ef-2773-4656-b8f6-b515107b1be7">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">receives loan transfers</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="524e205a-6fca-492e-9130-526186553941" target="36ea11ef-2773-4656-b8f6-b515107b1be7">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
    </edge>
