      <data key="d3">While the $50 processing fee applies to any partial withdrawal, it operates alongside the 7% surrender charge only if such a withdrawal occurs within the first two years. Thus, multiple fees could apply simultaneously depending on the nature and timing of the withdrawal.</data>
