    <edge source="0f79fac3-4cc7-4db8-9988-95a22ef09fff" target="db0522da-0d9d-479f-9d33-41c3c624b1ce">
      <data key="d3">Partial withdrawals may incur surrender charges, reinforcing that the surrender charge schedule applies not only to complete surrenders but also to any reduction in policy value through withdrawals.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.87</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0f79fac3-4cc7-4db8-9988-95a22ef09fff" target="5d223ba0-ac0f-4dce-85c5-d0617f2418c2">
      <data key="d3">Partial withdrawals are subject to surrender charges, which in the first two years are set at 7%, matching the detail provided in fact_sentence_1.</data>
      <data key="d4">includes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0f79fac3-4cc7-4db8-9988-95a22ef09fff" target="69608bdc-7106-4794-a6fc-06a70dd54130">
      <data key="d3">Partial withdrawals triggering surrender charges, as noted in Section 3.6, would include those made during Years 3–4 where the charge rate is specifically set at 5%.</data>
      <data key="d4">covered by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0f79fac3-4cc7-4db8-9988-95a22ef09fff" target="20ce4777-7e1a-4273-b5c7-82e39fac1476">
      <data key="d3">Partial withdrawals may incur surrender charges, which complements the specific case in fact_sentence_1 where a 3% charge applies to premium payments made in Year 5–6, illustrating that these charges persist across various policy actions.</data>
      <data key="d4">informs</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0f79fac3-4cc7-4db8-9988-95a22ef09fff" target="8fec2bf4-e22f-45fa-a2fe-5c9e5a9f591c">
      <data key="d3">Partial withdrawals are subject to potential surrender charges regardless of when premiums were paid, so the exemption from surrender charges on late premiums does not extend to withdrawal activity.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
