      <data key="d3">While partial withdrawals reduce the face amount proportionally, the lack of surrender charges after Year 7 means investors can withdraw funds later without paying exit fees, enhancing liquidity post-Year 7 despite reduction in coverage.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables flexibility</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
