      <data key="d3">A policy lapses if the account value fails to cover monthly deductions for 61 consecutive days; since the Mortality &amp; Expense Risk Charge is deducted daily, it significantly influences whether such a shortfall occurs.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes risk of</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.87</data>
    </edge>
