    <edge source="7f729579-af9d-4934-af44-77d11dd937c9" target="de961a5e-5f41-4f5c-bf49-5a1e1747afb2">
      <data key="d3">Evidence of insurability is required to reinstate a lapsed policy, meaning that the need for such documentation arises directly from the policy lapsing due to prolonged inability to meet deduction requirements.</data>
      <data key="d4">required after</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="7f729579-af9d-4934-af44-77d11dd937c9" target="e2d6b134-e378-4016-9aec-83160141d68a">
      <data key="d3">Proving insurability is necessary for reinstatement within three years, making timely awareness via the 30-day notice critical to fulfilling that requirement effectively.</data>
      <data key="d4">required by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="7f729579-af9d-4934-af44-77d11dd937c9" target="a270d4dd-8dc4-4636-bdb4-68ecbe2ee923">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 states that reinstatement requires proof of insurability, ensuring the insured remains eligible based on health. This condition operates independently of whether loan repayments have been made.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="7f729579-af9d-4934-af44-77d11dd937c9" target="e381b39e-f494-4cde-959e-aff5ec7c393c">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes that proof of insurability is required before reinstatement, ensuring the applicant remains eligible from a health standpoint. This condition complements fact_sentence_2, which mandates full financial restitution including interest, completing the non-financial and financial prerequisites respectively.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="7f729579-af9d-4934-af44-77d11dd937c9" target="82754332-e72e-42c2-8178-8d00ac6d8b55">
      <data key="d3">Proof of insurability is required to reinstate a lapsed policy, which occurs when account value fails to meet monthly deduction obligations.</data>
      <data key="d4">required for reinstatement</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
