      <data key="d3">Because the policy is described as being part of a regulated securities product governed by SEC oversight, the classification of its underlying investment vehicle—Pinnacle Investment Life Separate Account A—as a registered unit investment trust aligns with and reinforces this regulatory framework.</data>
